{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-03-17 13:13:00', 'title': 'MICRO E-MINI EQUITY INDEX FUTURES SURPASS 2 BILLION CONTRACTS TRADED', 'text': "CHICAGO , MARCH 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MICRO E-MINI EQUITY INDEX FUTURES SURPASSED 2 BILLION CONTRACTS TRADED ACROSS ALL FOUR INDICES ON MARCH 14. MICRO E-MINI EQUITY INDEX FUTURES BECAME AVAILABLE FOR TRADING ACROSS FOUR U.S. INDICES – S&P 500, NASDAQ-100, RUSSELL 2000 AND DOW JONES INDUSTRIAL AVERAGE – IN MAY OF 2019."}